{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act19mini_level_act19mini_st07",
  "groupId": "act19mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "小鎮志",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19mini/level_act19mini_st07.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d54a95fe44831edb1214a306fdd72ea17d2bed1bcb71594a4231867631d23d06",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "63_mini04_mountaintop"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還敢造次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "驚雷破空，崩飛了少女的佩刀，她也被巨大的力量衝擊倒地。\n黑色的濃雲在她的頭頂盤踞，更大的雷霆似乎隨時會從天而落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不想這道雷落在你的頭頂，就不要亂動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麟天師和左秉燭還真是死咬不放啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事情已經圓滿解決，又沒有造成什麼損傷，兩位真的有必要這樣苦苦相逼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫姑娘你說自己只想看戲，卻已有不少人，被捲入了這場“好戲”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用巨獸代理人之物召喚歲相，這樣的能耐絕非常人可及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老實交代，你究竟是什麼人？又從哪裡學會了這些禁術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，原來你在意的就只有這個啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "司歲台的秉燭人，這片大地上最古老的秘密就在你觸手可及的地方，你想做的事，竟然只有把試圖瞭解這些的人一個個抓回去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只聽說過物品有主人，知識又何來主人？憑什麼這些事只有司歲台能知道，別人就不能知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……憑你在邙山鎮的所作所為，讓人如何相信你沒有包藏禍心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我們走一趟，把你知道的事情，還有謀劃，統統交代清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，這樣聽起來我還是有些被活捉的價值嘛，那我要是執意想逃，你們是不是也沒辦法了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "執迷不悟……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，將你打暈帶回去也沒什麼區別——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天空中傳來一道聲響，但比那聲音更快的，是一道烈火。\n如刃的烈火劈散雷霆，一道身影落在黎博利面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年紀輕輕，這一手雷法還蠻有模有樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這源石技藝的手法還有點眼熟，難道白定山那一輩小孩也收徒弟了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的火焰法術……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您該不會是——祖師？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這個小姑娘，不是大荒城的時候，小滿姑娘的玩伴嗎……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天師府雷法傳人……麟青硯……拜見祖師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了行了，又不是什麼正經場合，不需要這些規矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小丫頭，你也來打個招呼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……山海眾莫佚，見過老天師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這個傢伙還真是山海眾。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼好驚訝的？有機會的話去翻翻你們藏書閣最裡面的那幾卷書吧，要論對巨獸的研究，你們才是後來的呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今我只看到山海眾舉著巨獸的旗號，為非作歹無惡不作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別人用山海眾的名號做殺人放火的事，那和我又有什麼關係？我還要管別人做什麼不成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你穿著這身漂亮制服，就能保證每一個穿這套衣服的都是好人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不著調的做事方式，還有這伶牙俐齒……還真是和你們祖師爺一個樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本來以為這麼多年都過去了，那個老木匠早就沒什麼傳人了，沒想到今天還能在這裡再碰到一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟一千年前的那場狩獵和祖師他的理念相悖，他老人家晚年也的確因此心灰意冷，不再發聲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是他老人家想要制止戰事的初衷，總還是有人記得的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "口氣倒不小，那你說說，就在當下，你打算如何制止戰事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很簡單，不論是盜取《武典》，還是召喚歲相，在下無非是想要見那位界園主人一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "懇請他准許我進入他的園林找一樣東西，我保證這場戰爭可以被終止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那位消失的代理人，留下來的一件東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "膽子倒是不小……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圓腦袋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在旁邊聽的時間夠久了吧，客人已經找上門了，到底要不要接待，給個說法吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天來的都是貴客……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位客人的提議，還真是嚇了在下一身冷汗啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "廢話少說，這件事和你們關係最大，你們有什麼打算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實剛剛我和先生也打過了招呼……正好，今天老天師與司歲台的秉燭人都在這裡，在下斗膽提議……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "緣分如此，今年的鎮撫儀式，就請這幾位客人來協助如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鎮撫儀式？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "司歲台每年都會檢查歲獸沉睡的狀態，加固歲陵的封印裝置，我們稱為鎮撫儀式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這件事歷來都是由最資深的秉燭人來負責……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾天前那位大逆不道的代理人進了歲陵，到現在還沒有消息。今年的鎮撫儀式到底要怎麼辦，司歲台應該也沒頭緒吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事關重大，我必須得請示——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得了，都什麼節骨眼了，哪還有時間讓你慢慢打報告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們只管進去，太傅那老頭子要是問起來，就說是我答應的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，這個女娃，跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正你和那個秉燭人小孩合不來，你們一路進去怕是得先打起來——你要找的東西，讓他幫你找就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關於你那位祖師爺，我還想和你多聊兩句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽命就是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1043_leizi2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我們該怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒也不難，進了界園，沿路向上走。多留心周圍風景，總能找到你們要找的東西的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其餘的，就是要小心界園裡的那些收藏了……先生的收藏所化的倀物和各位在那座小鎮裡見到的不可同日而語。諸位還請小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向上走？但我們現在不已經在山頂了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您說的這座“界園”，是在何處？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遠在天邊，近在眼前……各位身處的這座山，便與界園鄰近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帶大家進界園，自然不在話下，但是想要深入，還是需要一點緣分的——錄武官先生，你隨身帶著的那副棋盤，可以借在下一用嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然……請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有那位姑娘，你帶著的那本秘笈，現在可以交給在下了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1871_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……給你就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，開一個通道。從此通道中過，各位便有了進入界園禁入之地的緣分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兵戈縱橫，乾坤承序，起——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "棋盤與書本在梁的手中無限延展，撐起了一方天地。只一眨眼的功夫，山巔的景色變成平坦的田地。眾人穿過這片異樣的空間——\n踏出這方天地時，只見一扇屏風遮擋的大門入口出現在眾人面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諸位，歡迎來到，界園。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_yanshabbyroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "依稀記得，那場災禍之前，這裡原本是一座頗有生機的小鎮，數百戶人家，田舍錯落，阡陌縱橫……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼多年過去，如今這裡只剩下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都出來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽候梁先生吩咐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全部都到這裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（左顧右盼的動靜）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殘垣斷壁間還有一些碎瓦、磚石之類的，它們醒的時間很短，還聽不懂您說話……需要將它們拖出來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我先說明來意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽好，你們都需要離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（交頭接耳的聲響）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歲陵的那場異動，讓原本住在這裡的人們或亡或散，再無人煙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你們本是俗世器物，因此滯留，又受那場異動影響，在漫長的時間裡漸漸生出靈識，在附近遊蕩……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許你們已經感受到了，那座陵墓正上方的位置，有一個園子——易將它命名為，“界園”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論是炎國，還是我們這些兄弟姐妹，都不會允許界園附近存在一片有倀遊蕩的廢墟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，梁先生，我們該往何處去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "易說了，形優或質佳者，可以在園子裡找個落腳的位置，剩下的，都需要被清理乾淨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們有一個月的時間準備。希望到時候，這裡不會再有任何那場災禍的痕跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的生物&古怪的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wilderness_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "東側的這片區域已經清理乾淨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們再銜些草種撒在這裡，然後再去處理西側的區域，那邊原本是條穿鎮而過的河流，現在淤泥叢生，清理起來有些麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁先生，我們比照了您帶來的圖冊，符合要求的倀……數量不多，都在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先去幫它們的忙，晚一些，跟著我回界園。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真熱鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "易呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出遊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他嫌園子的一處涼亭附近有點空，準備找一些好東西回來裝點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像我每次來訪，都只有你在場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不正是他製造我出來的原因？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他那個人雖然好說話，但僅限於他感興趣的人和事而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他願意為了討一塊石頭和一個孩童聊三天三夜，被罵被趕也毫不動氣，但在你們這些人身邊，連一炷香也待不住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好吧。我確實也受不了他的假客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "言歸正傳吧。梁，你動工的速度未免有些慢啊。整整七天過去，這片廢墟才清理出來一小半。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將殘垣斷壁收拾乾淨並不難。但這裡有成百上千件沾染了倀氣的器物，要將它們妥善處理，有多麻煩，想必司歲台比我更清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明有更省事的辦法，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛剛沒聽錯的話，有幾隻器倀要跟著你回界園……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "司歲台的意思是，我應該將所有沾染了倀氣的器物，磚瓦草木、椅凳杯盞……統統搬進界園？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有那麼大的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，你剛剛不都還說，易嫌園子有點空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歲的那場醒覺，整座百灶城及周邊的大地都險些傾覆，你們兄弟姐妹也付出了慘痛的代價，連……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "且慢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "易說過，那已成往事。兄弟姐妹間都諱莫如深，更何況是和你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，界園自創想到興建，一直都攸關萬民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它矗立在陵墓的正上方，它是將那沉睡之物牢牢釘在夢魘之中的釘子，鎮邪撫祟，保百灶清朗……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想司歲台搞錯了一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "界園，首先是易的園子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去田十里，即至八方，容納古今，採擷珍奇，易恨不得把天下風光都搬進界園，也會為一塊石頭的位置把整個園子的格局一改再改……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它不是司歲台的法器，更不是歲陵的垃圾場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陵墓附近的倀，我會解決，其他的，還請司歲台不要過問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司歲台訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "東側不是已經清理完了，這隻器倀怎麼還往那邊跑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_yanshabbyroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古怪的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……有人過來了，你們先迴避。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是這裡沒錯、就是這裡沒錯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終於……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊抱歉抱歉，我才注意到這裡有人……是、是人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位，呃，奇怪的先生，看您的打扮，您該不會是如今負責巡視這片山地的官員吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……算是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一片偏僻難行，荒蕪不堪，已經多年不曾有普通人靠近了。你是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您應該知道，這裡以前是個小鎮，我曾經住在鎮上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那已經是很久之前的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多年前，這裡發生了一場災禍，一場沒有人能說得明白的可怕災禍，整個小鎮就這麼毀於一旦……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候我還是個不懂事的少年，我的家人都……只有我僥倖活了下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我後來去了姜齊，重新安頓下來，直到現在才回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從姜齊來這裡，很遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，很遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我走了很久，哈哈，這幾年存的錢都在路上花光了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是為了看看這片……廢墟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不不，我打算先休息兩天，等養足了力氣，就把這間屋子修好，再去周圍開墾幾壟田出來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，我不打算走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不明白。你已經在姜齊有了新的生活，為什麼還要執著於這些斷壁殘垣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許在您的眼中這裡只是一片廢墟，幾根斷掉的房梁、幾片破磚爛瓦，還有滿地的荒草……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但哪怕過了這麼多年，我還是記得自己把存下來的零用錢藏在這間屋子的角落，等著貨郎經過的時候去買一根糖葫蘆……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還記得和鄰家的同伴打架，一起幫在田裡辛苦的爸媽送飯，一起去鎮西邊的私塾上課……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是我的家鄉，先生，哪怕它已經毀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如你所說，這裡已經毀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還記得那場災禍，你就不擔心再次……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這片大地到處都是天災，先生，有哪一片土地完全沒經歷過災禍呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "災禍只能打斷我們的生活，它走了，我們就回來。我們修好房子，整平土地，一遍又一遍……千年百年都是這樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我動身之前，也遇到過其他逃難到別處的人，大家也都有回來的心思，我想大概過不了多久……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老話說，日子久了，連物品都會對一個地方有感情，更何況是人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你不能在此滯留……起碼這幾天不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "官府對這一片山地有些別的規劃，你先到最近的館驛安頓，再等消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎喲——奇怪，剛剛是什麼東西絆了我一下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼，我送你離開吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_yanshabbyroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "寂靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再不出來，我就沒那麼好說話了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "角落裡響起窸窣的動靜，良久，一個瓶狀的器倀慢慢地挪到了梁的身前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "司歲台的人來時，到處亂竄的也是你吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一片已經被清理乾淨，你為什麼躲藏在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不願意被銷毀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（上下晃動）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那跟我進界園呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（左右晃動）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要留在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（上下晃動）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，我等人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等把我製造出來的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡還是小鎮的時候，一個叫蘭可的書生和一個叫白錦的女子把我做出來。他們說，我會是他們為新家製造的第一個物品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們約定好了，成親之後，會把我擺在客廳最顯眼的位置上，然後每天插一束花，誰也不許忘記。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們一起捏好了瓶胚，把我放進窯裡，等待燒製的時間裡，他們各自離開，去做別的事情……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，那場災禍就發生了，他們再也沒有回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我一直在等他們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你哪裡也不去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我哪裡也不去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生先生……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "書簡狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，請你不要生它的氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "書簡狀的生物在梁的身前站定，它的身體向前彎曲出一個明顯的幅度，竹簡片因為用力而發白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在……作揖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "書簡狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "書簡狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鄭重的請求，應當行禮才對，這是我以前學到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "書簡狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小鎮西邊以前有一座私塾，我是書櫃上最高那層最外側的書簡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "書簡狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生教導學生們說，學書，首先當知禮。他強調過很多次，我就記下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "書簡狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它不是故意違逆你的命令，它只是，這麼多年來一直都只有這一個念頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "書簡狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還請先生答應它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "書簡狀的生物再次向梁作了一揖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不答應也沒關係，總之不許傷害它！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "劍狀的生物擋在了瓶狀的生物和書簡狀的生物之前，它將頭，也就是劍尖對準了梁，日光在劍鋒上反射出光亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劍狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它是我的……我的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知音？朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劍狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個瓶子，我問你幾個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生請問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你從什麼時候開始有這個念頭的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從不懷疑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼要懷疑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓶狀的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過了這麼久，剛剛那個跑到姜齊的人都回來了，蘭可和白錦也一定會回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "梁沉默著，風灌進他空空的顱腔，連帶著胸部的機關裝置也被撥動，發出幽幽的聲響。\n梁彷彿在思考。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一直以來，我以為你們只是受那個傢伙的感染，生出了朦朦朧朧的靈識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們在這附近遊蕩，所言所行也均會受作為器物的屬性所限……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想不到，你們竟然有了如人般的情緒與念想……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "返鄉的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老話說，日子久了，連物品都會對一個地方有感情，更何況是人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒也有趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們都是那場災禍之後，滯留在此的器倀，你們還記得當年那座小鎮的樣子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，我們記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們能夠復原它嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們，願意與人們一起生活嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "63_mini01_market"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁，你瞞了我好一場啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我讓你清掃乾淨這片廢墟，將器倀們該銷毀的銷毀，該帶回界園的帶回界園……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果，你變出了一個小鎮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說得好像你不知道一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "易，我是你的造物，我所想即是你所想，我所行即是你所行。巧奪天工，不過是心化外物而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，原來是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說，這是最好的解決方案，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歲陵附近沾染了倀氣的器物太多，一味銷毀或者塞進我們的園子，也不是個辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而這座小鎮哪怕變成了廢墟，仍有離散的人陸陸續續回來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說的倀的變化，倒是很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，讓倀和人一起生活，司歲台免不了又得嘮嘮叨叨。你是怎麼跟他們交代的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我答應了他們會監管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“要是只有那麼一個園子，就我和易兩個人，管住那麼多倀，我們可沒那個本事。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“要是哪天我們一個沒管住，倀們衝出來，到時候就像對付當年的邙山鎮一樣，第一個衝了司歲台，再來就是整個百灶。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你辦事一向不用我操心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總而言之，是件好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一座與界園近在咫尺的小鎮，倒也足以留住那些不懷好意者的腳步，讓我們提前做好迎客的準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "63_mini01_market"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "易",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1869_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁，把園子打掃乾淨，準備迎客吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
